  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "22fee9e0-2df6-4279-801a-11edb0487342"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the options a causal substrate is drawn with at a given size"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"cb6aedba-d5ef-4d56-ab21-9f657abe3e1f"],

Cell[TextData[{
