  "efa8d586-fc4c-4c7c-8245-6bda4d6176b2"],
 " events: the Hasse diagram of a transitive percolation with link \
probability ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["p", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "e565329b-0294-41f1-8ec7-a4d44cc131d9"],
